Ash: Birch, Cedar
Birch: Ash, Dogwood
Cedar: Ash, Dogwood, Hazel
Dogwood: Birch, Cedar, Elm
Elm: Dogwood, Fig
Fig: Elm, Hazel
Hazel: Cedar, Fig
Gum: no stations next to it

Ash -> Cedar -> Hazel -> Fig (3 stops)
Ash -> Birch -> Dogwood -> Elm (3 stops)
There's no way from Ash to Gum.

Stops from Ash: "Ash" is 0, "Birch" is 1, "Cedar" is 1, "Dogwood" is 2, "Hazel" is 2, "Elm" is 3 and "Fig" is 3
Gum can't be reached from Ash.
